==============================================================================
READING
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 M1 = 1/n exactly at every n tested => LRC holds in range AND the AP is a
 minimax extremizer. The TIGHT FAMILY and the MARGIN mu(n)=M2-1/n are the
 real content: a positive, clean margin means only the tight family is
 delicate and everything else clears with room. At doubled primes the
 extremizer necklace's rotation-by-2 cycle type is read off directly.
